# Staff contact info stays OUT of the repo (names + email addresses). Keep your working copy
# locally or in Drive; this pattern stops it being committed again by accident.
site_coordinators_PRIVATE.md
site_coordinators*.md

# Credentials. clasp writes .clasprc.json (an OAuth refresh token) into the project dir when you
# log in locally — committing it would hand over write access to the Apps Script project. The
# deploy workflow injects it from the CLASPRC_JSON repository secret instead.
.clasprc.json
**/.clasprc.json
.clasp.json.local
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
credentials.json
client_secret*.json
service-account*.json
token.json

